      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Hyperthyroidism can indeed complicate ADHD treatment, but your heart racing could be due to the thyroid issue itself. I wouldn't recommend altering your Adderall dosage without consulting a specialist, but adding magnesium might help with your heart rate. It's essential to monitor your symptoms closely and consider a comprehensive approach, but don't delay seeking professional advice. Your health is paramount, and a tailored plan from a specialist will ensure both conditions are managed effectively.",
      "source": "target",
